{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12157","headline":"奉使采箭簳竹谷中晨兴赴岭 · 钱起","name":"奉使采箭簳竹谷中晨兴赴岭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤客倦夜坐，闻猨乘早发。\n背溪已斜汉，登栈尚残月。\n重峰转森爽，幽步更超越。\n云木耸鹤巢，风萝扫虎穴。\n人羣从自远，世役终难歇。\n入山非买山，采竹异采蕨。\n谁见子牟意，悁劳书魏阙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}